1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,367
Sam steps off. The door sighs shut
behind him. Walt is under the hood,
and he doesn't see.

2
00:00:05,867 --> 00:00:12,400
Rule one. Never all get off together.
Someone stays with the bus, with the
engine, with the way home.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:19,933
You jump out after him. Too late. The
old lady is gone, and so is the
suitcase. Sam is walking up Main
Street, whistling.
